":[{"term":"서울로","audio":"/audio/38f2f54e31b0b7c1b433.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"돌아가는","meaning":"返回","explanation":"돌아가다：返回；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"돌아가다","audio":"/audio/1152d7a56fb1600a5774.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74103","senseId":"8","lemma":"돌아가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"길이야.","meaning":"路上","explanation":"길：路上；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"길","audio":"/audio/d72c8434585436678000.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59251","senseId":"9","lemma":"길","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"998538467e18fc3a","term":"고향","zh":"故乡，家乡","audio":"/audio/998538467e18fc3a541b.mp3","entryId":"27364","definition":"出生成长的地方。","pronunciation":["고향"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"从一个地方移动到另一个地方。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"df159f47a890ff65","term":"지금","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3","entryId":"62522","definition":"指正在说话的此时。","pronunciation":["지금"]},{"id":"1152d7a56fb1600a","term":"돌아가다","zh":"返回","audio":"/audio/1152d7a56fb1600a5774.mp3","entryId":"74103","definition":"回到原来所在的地方或重新成为原来的状态。","pronunciation":["도라가다"]},{"id":"d72c843458543667","term":"길","zh":"路上","audio":"/audio/d72c8434585436678000.mp3","entryId":"59251","definition":"移向某处的途中。","pronunciation":["길"]}],"audio":"/audio/f503eb8a2af4cf63d987.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.48,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=59251","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"9","sourceLevel":"초급","day":12,"sequenceScore":0.502,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我回了趟老家，现在正在回首尔的路上。","喂？你在哪里？","可以把剩下的食物给那只小狗吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["喂？你在哪里？","可以把剩下的食物给那只小狗吗？","我回了趟老家，现在正在回首尔的路上。"],"answer":2}]}
